add('scribe', 'C3Docs', f"""Draft the documentation edits that land with C3 as {D('docs-f1.md')}: (1) in-place replacement of the F1 coverage-map row in {L}/corpus/README.md (the row starting `| F1 git-native housekeeping vs receipts |`) adding backticked `knowledge/jj-abandoned-object-mtime-clock.md` to its entries column; (2) an appended `## Round 32 — F1 the abandoned object's own mtime clock` section at the end of that file in the style of `## Round 31 — ...`, with `### Frontier (r32)` (F1 remaining after this: the fleet exposure numerator re-census and any arm the record could not settle; F2-F4 unchanged; F5 list-only; Certification OFF, K5 HELD) and `### Round 32 corrections`; (3) a one-paragraph `## Round 32 boundary note (F1 mtime clock)` for {L}/PROVINCE.md; (4) one new SKILL.md error-pattern bullet for the result, citing the new entry, and SKILL.md `## Gate registry` rows for `tests/fixtures/r32-jj-mtime-clock.sh`, `tools/souji-record-contract.py` and `census/round-32/c2-counter.py` (read that table first, match its columns). Use placeholders `<RESULT ...>` for measured lines. Read each target section first; match style.""")
